From d9d51d920983725cfd9161b339518803320bb38c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 14:18:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 06/17] invariant: the synthetic panel has the vendors' shape
 and a known plant

100 series 1989-2019 with ragged starts drawn from the real coverage
distribution, a month-end-only stretch before a break date, unaligned gaps, six
hedged flags and five latent factors. plant() injects a predictive relationship
of stated strength so phase 1 has ground truth. Vendor backends raise rather
than returning an empty panel, which would be misread as a coverage failure.
